      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "asynchronous - \"takes an unpredictable amount of time to complete\"\n\n> 16.667 ms - you can't run it synchronously\n\n\ni/0 bound -\n    100% api calls.\n\nprocessor bound\n    - big calculations, stats, generating pdfs, whatever.\n    - Service Workers\n    - These are load some JS into a \"container\" where they run\n      on a different thread of execution\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "asynchronous - \"takes an unpredictable amount of time to complete\"\n\n> 16.667 ms - you can't run it synchronously\n\n\ni/0 bound -\n    100% api calls.\n\nprocessor bound\n    - big calculations, stats, generating pdfs, whatever.\n    - Service Workers\n    - These are load some JS into a \"container\" where they run\n      on a different thread of execution\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
